{c: Verse 1}
[D]Hum kis gali jaa [A]rahe hai,        [D]Hum kis gali jaa [A]rahe hai
[G]Apna koi thi [A]kana [D]nahin [A],        [G]Apna koi thi [A]kana [D]nahin
[D]Armaano ki [A]anjuman main,        [D]Besood hai apni [A]lagan main
[G]Aapna koi [A]fasana [D]nahin [A],        [G]Aapna koi [A]fasana [D]nahin
[G]Yeah e yeah e [A]yeah e a,        [G]oo oo o [A]o oo o
[D]Ek ajnaabi [A]sa chehra,        [G]rehta hai meri [A]nazar mein
[D]Ek dard [A]aake thehra,        [G]din raat dard e [A]jigar mein
[D]Jaagi hai kaisi [A]talab si,        [D]Yeh arzoon hai [A]ajab si
[G]Lekin [A]kisiko [D]batana [A]nahin,        [G]Lekin kisiko [A]batana [D]nahin
[D]Betaabiyaan hai [A]pal pal,        [G]chhaya yeh kaisa [A]nasha hai
[D]Khamoshiyan main [A]saada,        [G]hosh bhi [A]gumshuda hai
[D]Dar dar par [A]ghoomta hai,        [D]Masti main kyun [A]jhumta hai
[G]Deewane [A]dil ne [D]jaana [A]nahin,        [G]Deewane [A]dil ne [D]jaana nahin
